# Secrets and commercial scanner binaries
**/credentials.yml
**/credentials.yaml
**/*vault*
*.lic
*.lic.*
packages/**
!packages/
!packages/windows/
!packages/linux/
!packages/windows/.gitkeep
!packages/linux/.gitkeep
licenses/**
!licenses/
